OL,3,GNEWSAFirst Restore Britain councillor
OL,4,Ain the West
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Gloucestershire councillor has quit
OL,7,FReform UK to join the Restore Britain
OL,8,Fparty.
OL,10,FMichael Rees, who was elected to the
OL,11,Fcounty council in May 2025, said he did
OL,12,Fnot like the direction Reform UK had
OL,13,Fbeen going in, including accepting an
OL,14,Finflux of ex-Conservative MPs.
OL,16,FA local spokesperson for Reform UK
OL,17,Faccused the councillor of "betraying
OL,18,Fresidents who voted for him".
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
