OL,3,GNEWSAFirst Restore Britain councillor
OL,4,Ain the West
OL,5,
OL,6,FCounty council leader, Liberal Democrat
OL,7,FLisa Spivey, said the latest defection
OL,8,F"adds to a growing pattern of
OL,9,Finstability" in Reform UK.
